{#
  The closing call-to-action, once.

  ⚠️ THIS FIXES A REAL LAYOUT BUG, it is not only de-duplication. `.cta .grid` in
  assets/css/style.css declares TWO columns — grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr — and
  about-us.njk fills both: copy on the left, a white card on the right. The roof and
  services pages were only ever given the left child, so the right column rendered
  empty. Measured in a browser at 1440px: a 1104px grid, 548px of content, 498px of
  nothing. Roughly 45% of the section was dead space on both pages.

  The card here holds the phone, the email and the button — all of which were already
  on those pages, crammed under the copy in the left column. Nothing new is written;
  it moves into the column the layout was always expecting.

  ⚠️ THE BUTTON CARRIES NO MARGIN OF ITS OWN. `.qform` is `display:grid; gap:14px`, so
  spacing comes from the grid. The original markup had an inline margin-top:28px from
  when this sat in a plain column, and keeping it would double up.

  ⚠️ AND THE CARD OVERRIDES ITS OWN BACKGROUND, which is not a flourish. `.qform`
  defaults to var(--bg-soft) and the whole `.cta` section is already that colour, so
  without the override the card is invisible against it. about-us.njk does the same
  thing for the same reason.

  ⚠️ IMPORT IT `with context`, OR THE PHONE AND EMAIL COME OUT EMPTY. An imported
  Nunjucks macro cannot see the calling template's globals, so `site.phone_link` inside
  this card resolves to nothing — and it fails silently, rendering <a href=""></a>: a
  contact card with a dead phone link and no number in it. The first build after this
  was written did exactly that, and the markup still looked right.

  Usage — ledes is a list, so a page with two paragraphs needs no second call:
    {% from "cta-section.njk" import ctaSection with context %}
    {{ ctaSection("Free, no-obligation", "Not sure which service\nyou need? Just ask.",
                  ["Tell us what you are looking at…"], "Get a free quote") }}
#}
{% macro ctaSection(eyebrow, headingText, ledes, buttonLabel) -%}
<section class="cta cta--stacked">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        {%- if eyebrow %}
        <span class="eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</span>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if headingText %}
        <h2>{{ headingText | heading | safe }}</h2>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- for p in ledes %}
        <p class="lede">{{ p }}</p>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="qform" style="background:#fff;border-color:rgba(22,20,19,.18)">
        <div class="contact-list">
          <div class="row"><span class="lbl">Phone</span><a href="{{ site.phone_link }}">{{ site.phone_display }}</a></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="lbl">Email</span><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></div>
        </div>
        <div><a class="btn btn--yellow btn--lg" href="/contact-us/">{{ buttonLabel }} <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endmacro %}
